                        


Item #:  SCP-5934

Object Class:  safe

Special Containment Procedures:  Subject should be allowed to roam the facility between 6A.M and 7 P.M, and should be placed in a 3x3x3 meter containment area for sleeping. if another Scp breaches containment, The subject should be moved to the loose Scp if it is Euclid or above.

Description:  Scp 5934 is a group of glowing orbs that can change their colouration at will. If any sentient entities enter within a 5 Meter radius, Scp 5934 will begin to sing. this song has a soothing effect on all exposed sentient entities. It is unknown why the subject's song has this effect, further research is required. Scp 5934 can be used to contain Scps and suppress D-class personnel.

Addendum:  Scp 5934 seems to dislike certain entities, and will sing a song that will enrage the target. there is no obvious connection between the disliked entities.

A list of Disliked entities

Scp 096

Scp 106

Scp 173

Scp 303

D-238

D-566

D-926







                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
